Package: catdir
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3
Recommends: fd-find | ripgrep
Description: Directory-to-context text aggregator
 catdir crawls a directory, filters out binary files, respects depths and
 sizes, and outputs a cleanly structured layout or JSON stream. Ideal for
 gathering codebase context for analysis or documentation.
